WEBVTT

00:05.797 --> 00:06.923
Excuse me.

00:07.048 --> 00:10.552
Can you give me the basket,
some bamboo and straw?

00:11.136 --> 00:13.346
I don't mind.

00:13.555 --> 00:15.890
But the basket has a hole.

00:16.099 --> 00:18.059
All right, I'll pay you.

00:18.143 --> 00:19.436
No, you don't have to.

00:19.519 --> 00:21.312
It's torn anyway.

00:21.646 --> 00:23.148
No, I want to pay.

00:23.481 --> 00:24.983
No need.

00:25.066 --> 00:26.985
I'll give you the bamboo and straw too.

00:27.235 --> 00:28.528
I still want to pay you!

00:28.653 --> 00:30.030
No, you don't!

00:30.155 --> 00:32.073
You're such a stubborn kid!

00:33.658 --> 00:36.494
Please accept this. I only have coins!

00:36.578 --> 00:38.329
Thank you very much!

00:38.413 --> 00:40.498
That hurts!

00:43.793 --> 00:44.836
Nezuko.

00:45.336 --> 00:46.296
That's odd.

00:46.379 --> 00:47.338
Nezuko?

00:47.797 --> 00:48.965
Where are you?

00:51.551 --> 00:52.469
There you are.

02:33.862 --> 02:35.071
Nezuko.

02:36.531 --> 02:38.032
You dug a hole.

02:38.616 --> 02:41.661
Nezuko became like a mole.

02:45.456 --> 02:48.209
Plus, she looks really upset.

02:48.668 --> 02:51.045
She really doesn't want
to be under the sun.

02:52.213 --> 02:53.506
Wait for a while.

02:57.886 --> 02:58.803
Nezuko.

02:59.012 --> 02:59.971
Nezuko.

03:00.680 --> 03:02.140
Do you want to get inside?

03:02.640 --> 03:05.018
I want to continue
with our journey during the day.

03:05.810 --> 03:07.770
I will carry you.

03:09.606 --> 03:10.648
Get in here.

03:10.899 --> 03:13.192
Here, the basket.

03:20.408 --> 03:21.701
You can't fit inside.

03:23.286 --> 03:26.205
It seems Nezuko has grown up.

03:26.456 --> 03:29.167
She used to be smaller last time.

03:31.169 --> 03:32.253
Nezuko.

03:32.337 --> 03:35.965
Previously, you suddenly grew up
and became a woman.

03:36.549 --> 03:39.135
Can you reverse the effect
and become smaller?

03:39.969 --> 03:42.055
Become smaller, Nezuko.

03:42.138 --> 03:43.765
Can you become smaller?

03:54.484 --> 03:55.818
How amazing.

03:55.985 --> 03:57.570
You're a good girl, Nezuko.

03:57.737 --> 03:58.905
Amazing.

04:03.034 --> 04:04.494
Sagiri Mountain?

04:04.911 --> 04:09.082
If you want to go to Sagiri Mountain,
you must cross that mountain first.

04:09.582 --> 04:11.167
But the sun is setting.

04:11.251 --> 04:13.670
Do you want to go there
while carrying this huge baggage?

04:13.962 --> 04:15.129
It will be dangerous.

04:16.172 --> 04:17.882
I'll be very careful.

04:18.591 --> 04:20.051
Thank you very much.

04:23.638 --> 04:26.724
Recently, many people have been
missing mysteriously.

04:26.975 --> 04:28.434
Don't get lost!

04:38.027 --> 04:39.362
There's a shrine.

04:40.363 --> 04:41.906
The light is on.

04:41.990 --> 04:43.866
There must be someone inside.

04:44.200 --> 04:45.243
Let's see.

04:49.497 --> 04:50.873
The smell of blood.

04:51.666 --> 04:53.293
This mountainous road is very steep.

04:53.376 --> 04:54.919
Someone must have hurt themselves.

05:02.468 --> 05:03.678
Are you okay?

05:11.144 --> 05:13.229
What do you want?

05:14.105 --> 05:16.607
This is my territory.

05:17.358 --> 05:19.569
If you want to destroy my dining place,

05:19.944 --> 05:21.571
I won't forgive you.

05:22.155 --> 05:23.364
A man-eating demon.

05:36.961 --> 05:39.213
Something doesn't feel right.

05:40.548 --> 05:43.926
Are you two humans?

05:59.567 --> 06:00.735
An ax.

06:00.818 --> 06:01.819
Not bad.

06:02.403 --> 06:06.657
But this minor wound
will heal immediately.

06:09.535 --> 06:12.538
Look, it's no longer bleeding.

06:30.014 --> 06:31.140
He's fast.

06:31.474 --> 06:33.309
How is he so strong?

06:33.893 --> 06:35.937
I won't get chopped by you twice.

06:36.646 --> 06:39.649
Watch, I'm going to snap your neck.

07:02.547 --> 07:05.508
You actually killed him.

07:05.842 --> 07:08.302
But he's a man-eating demon.

07:08.511 --> 07:10.471
Nezuko.

07:15.726 --> 07:17.145
How unbelievable.

07:17.353 --> 07:18.729
His head fell off.

07:18.813 --> 07:20.606
But his body could still move.

07:20.731 --> 07:22.066
You two!

07:23.609 --> 07:26.028
So one of you is a demon after all.

07:26.112 --> 07:28.406
No wonder the smell is strange.

07:28.614 --> 07:31.409
Why is a demon
hanging around with a human?

07:31.659 --> 07:33.494
He can still talk!

07:42.128 --> 07:43.212
Stop it!

07:51.596 --> 07:52.930
Nezuko!

08:00.688 --> 08:01.898
Nezuko!

08:07.528 --> 08:09.864
What the hell is this?

08:09.989 --> 08:12.283
He grew hands from his head.

08:12.658 --> 08:14.577
I want to save Nezuko.

08:16.162 --> 08:18.164
Move away!

08:22.835 --> 08:24.754
This kid is tough.

08:25.588 --> 08:26.923
His head is as hard

08:27.340 --> 08:28.716
as a rock.

08:38.351 --> 08:39.352
All right.

08:40.853 --> 08:44.357
I wanted to take away his ax,
but it ended up getting stuck in my hair.

08:44.440 --> 08:45.566
Damn it.

08:47.944 --> 08:50.863
Nezuko! Where are you?

09:03.459 --> 09:04.418
Nezuko.

09:05.086 --> 09:06.337
Stop it!

09:33.447 --> 09:36.617
Are there a lot of demons?

09:37.785 --> 09:40.162
You don't smell the same
as the one at my house.

09:40.538 --> 09:41.664
It wasn't you.

09:42.707 --> 09:45.960
But if I don't kill him,

09:46.252 --> 09:47.712
he'll eat someone else.

09:48.713 --> 09:49.672
So...

09:50.965 --> 09:52.300
I'll do the deed.

09:58.639 --> 09:59.724
I'll do it!

10:09.150 --> 10:12.361
That won't kill him.

10:14.155 --> 10:15.406
Tengu mask?

10:16.115 --> 10:18.618
This person walks with no sound.

10:19.744 --> 10:23.039
How can I kill him?

10:23.539 --> 10:25.082
Don't ask me.

10:25.374 --> 10:28.127
Can't you figure it out yourself?

10:31.631 --> 10:33.132
If piercing him doesn't kill him,

10:34.884 --> 10:36.552
I can only beat his head to a pulp.

10:44.560 --> 10:47.188
I need to break all his bones
and destroy the entire head.

10:47.396 --> 10:50.274
I must hit him
with this rock continuously.

10:51.317 --> 10:52.693
This will hurt a lot.

10:53.694 --> 10:56.947
Isn't there a way
to kill him with one hit?

11:02.870 --> 11:04.705
This kid won't cut it.

11:05.873 --> 11:09.293
He's unable to make a decision
because he's too considerate.

11:10.211 --> 11:14.340
The demon is in front of him,
but I can still smell his kindness.

11:14.673 --> 11:17.551
He actually has sympathy for demons.

11:19.136 --> 11:20.304
Giyu.

11:21.430 --> 11:23.599
This kid won't cut it.

11:29.855 --> 11:31.857
I passed out.

11:32.566 --> 11:35.027
Could it be that my body is dead?

11:35.236 --> 11:37.321
I feel extremely uncomfortable.

11:39.532 --> 11:41.325
Damn it! I'm going to kill you.

11:41.409 --> 11:42.743
I'll eat your flesh and bones.

11:42.827 --> 11:44.703
Come over here. Come.

11:45.037 --> 11:46.372
I can't go to you.

11:46.455 --> 11:47.748
Come over here.

11:48.916 --> 11:52.086
-If I dillydally, the sun will come up.
-Come over here now.

11:52.169 --> 11:54.255
Hey! Are you listening? Damn you!

12:06.767 --> 12:09.270
He became like that
after being exposed to the sun.

12:09.687 --> 12:11.522
No wonder Nezuko hates the sun.

12:14.191 --> 12:15.192
Nezuko?

12:15.734 --> 12:16.819
Nezuko!

12:32.001 --> 12:33.127
Nezuko.

12:37.423 --> 12:39.675
Right, where's that man?

12:48.934 --> 12:52.188
He buried all the people
who were murdered.

12:57.568 --> 12:58.527
Excuse me.

13:00.946 --> 13:03.908
I'm Sakonji Urokodaki.

13:04.283 --> 13:07.995
You're the one recommended
by Giyu Tomioka, aren't you?

13:08.496 --> 13:09.497
Yes.

13:09.580 --> 13:11.290
I'm Tanjiro Kamado.

13:11.874 --> 13:13.667
My younger sister is Nezuko.

13:13.792 --> 13:15.294
Tanjiro.

13:15.920 --> 13:19.215
If your sister eats people,
what will you do?

13:29.767 --> 13:31.560
Your judgment is too slow!

13:32.436 --> 13:35.356
Anyway, you delayed in making a judgment.

13:35.689 --> 13:39.151
So you couldn't kill the demon
until the morning comes.

13:39.818 --> 13:44.490
Why didn't you reply instantly
to my question just now?

13:44.740 --> 13:47.284
Because your determination is shallow.

13:47.993 --> 13:51.247
When your sister eats people,
there are only two things you can do.

13:51.539 --> 13:55.626
After you kill your sister,
kill yourself by disembowelment.

13:55.960 --> 14:00.172
If you want to bring along
your demonic sister, you must be aware.

14:01.006 --> 14:04.093
But there's something
that could never happen.

14:04.176 --> 14:05.970
You better remember this.

14:06.512 --> 14:09.807
Letting your sister
take away innocent lives.

14:09.974 --> 14:12.935
You must never let that happen.

14:13.727 --> 14:16.146
Do you understand what I said?

14:16.230 --> 14:17.231
Yes.

14:18.190 --> 14:24.613
I will now test your suitability
to become a demon slayer.

14:25.739 --> 14:28.284
Get your sister and follow me.

14:38.085 --> 14:39.086
He's fast.

14:39.253 --> 14:41.255
How old is this person?

14:41.547 --> 14:44.675
His footsteps make no sound at all.

14:46.677 --> 14:47.720
Nezuko.

14:47.803 --> 14:49.930
It's shaking too much, right?
Bear with me.

14:52.641 --> 14:57.563
You've always been patient, haven't you?

14:59.440 --> 15:01.317
Are you mending your kimono again?

15:01.859 --> 15:04.320
I must buy a new one for you.

15:04.862 --> 15:07.197
Never mind, it's okay.

15:07.281 --> 15:09.241
I really like this kimono.

15:09.950 --> 15:14.163
Instead of buying kimonos,
you should buy more food for the others.

15:16.749 --> 15:19.293
I'll definitely turn you back into human.

15:19.710 --> 15:22.922
One day, I'll buy
beautiful kimonos for you.

15:23.756 --> 15:25.966
The things I couldn't do for the others,

15:26.884 --> 15:28.344
I'll do them for you.

15:35.142 --> 15:41.315
At this rate, will you accept me?

15:48.906 --> 15:51.033
The test is about to begin now.

15:51.325 --> 15:53.118
Go up the mountain.

15:58.123 --> 16:01.710
I'll take the responsibility
of looking after her.

16:03.671 --> 16:05.297
Sorry for troubling you.

16:18.102 --> 16:22.481
I can't really move my legs
because I'm too tired.

16:23.399 --> 16:25.234
My head is getting dizzy too.

16:29.446 --> 16:33.283
Go down the mountain from here
and go to my house.

16:33.951 --> 16:36.453
I won't wait for you
until the sun comes out this time.

16:42.001 --> 16:43.085
Is that all?

16:45.754 --> 16:46.714
I get it.

16:47.089 --> 16:50.217
He thinks I'll get lost in the mist.

16:51.385 --> 16:53.762
I'll be fine if I go back
before the sun comes out.

16:54.430 --> 16:55.556
That's easy.

16:55.723 --> 16:57.224
I have a good nose.

16:57.599 --> 17:00.185
Plus, I already remember
the smell of Mr. Urokodaki.

17:11.572 --> 17:12.614
A rock.

17:24.668 --> 17:25.878
A pitfall trap.

17:27.379 --> 17:28.630
I see.

17:29.423 --> 17:31.842
There are traps on my way back.

17:32.676 --> 17:34.344
So, that's the case.

17:36.055 --> 17:37.014
Damn it!

17:43.187 --> 17:44.897
This is bad.

17:45.314 --> 17:47.232
If I continue to fall for these traps,

17:47.441 --> 17:49.318
I can't go down the mountain
before daylight.

17:50.110 --> 17:52.154
Plus, this mountain...

17:52.613 --> 17:53.906
This mountain...

17:55.032 --> 17:56.784
The air is thin.

17:57.201 --> 17:59.036
It's thinner than the mountain I lived in.

17:59.119 --> 18:00.537
That's why it's hard to breathe.

18:01.246 --> 18:03.582
I'm getting dizzy and losing vision.

18:03.665 --> 18:05.250
I might just faint and die here

18:06.293 --> 18:09.588
before I even made it back.

18:10.422 --> 18:12.841
No, I must go back.

18:13.842 --> 18:18.013
I need to adjust my breathing
and smell the traps out.

18:43.038 --> 18:44.706
Okay, I can tell.

18:44.790 --> 18:45.833
I can tell.

18:46.250 --> 18:47.960
The traps set by people.

18:48.377 --> 18:50.754
The smell is slightly different.

18:57.386 --> 18:58.679
Although that's the case,

19:00.514 --> 19:02.891
I can't suddenly enhance
my physical ability

19:02.975 --> 19:06.270
to dodge all the traps.

19:07.146 --> 19:09.982
I'll definitely go back.

19:10.816 --> 19:12.317
Nezuko!

19:41.638 --> 19:45.350
I am back.

19:48.270 --> 19:51.523
I'll keep this short,
Mr. Sakonji Urokodaki.

19:53.066 --> 19:55.861
I asked a teenager who wanted
to become a demon slayer

19:56.236 --> 19:57.863
to find you.

19:59.406 --> 20:02.367
He has the bravery
to challenge me unarmed.

20:04.161 --> 20:06.205
His family was murdered by demons.

20:06.580 --> 20:09.416
His only surviving sister became a demon.

20:10.167 --> 20:12.878
But from my judgment,
she won't hurt humans.

20:14.713 --> 20:19.259
From this pair of siblings,
I felt something extraordinary.

20:20.469 --> 20:24.223
It seems that the young man
has a good nose like yourself.

20:25.682 --> 20:30.854
Maybe one day, he'll make a breakthrough
and become your heir.

20:31.813 --> 20:34.399
I'm asking you to train him.

20:36.235 --> 20:38.946
I understand how unreasonable this is.

20:39.488 --> 20:41.281
Please forgive me.

20:42.866 --> 20:46.328
Please take good care of yourself.

20:47.037 --> 20:48.705
All the best on improving yourself.

20:50.540 --> 20:53.752
I still have many things
to tell you. Giyu Tomioka.

21:12.187 --> 21:14.064
I accept you,

21:14.606 --> 21:16.525
Tanjiro Kamado.

22:52.913 --> 22:55.415
The demon in the shrine was so scary.

22:55.624 --> 22:58.043
His hands grew out of his head.

22:59.711 --> 23:02.047
Since I already got accepted
by Master Urokodaki,

23:02.130 --> 23:04.299
I'll work harder from now on.

23:05.675 --> 23:08.595
Here's a little gossip
from the Taisho era.

23:08.845 --> 23:11.681
Master Urokodaki,
the trainer who wears a tengu mask.

23:11.765 --> 23:13.183
His age is actually--

23:13.266 --> 23:14.851
-Tanjiro!
-Yes!

23:15.018 --> 23:17.938
Do you want stewed beef and potatoes
or fish cake stew for dinner?

23:18.021 --> 23:19.856
Well...

23:20.107 --> 23:21.483
Your judgment is too slow!

23:21.566 --> 23:23.026
I want to eat fish cake stew!

23:23.360 --> 23:25.737
Next, episode 3, "Sabito and Makomo."

23:26.488 --> 23:27.697
TO BE CONTINUED

23:27.781 --> 23:29.116
Subtitle translation by Michelle Chai
